-// HELD-OUT evaluation set, written on 2026-11-02 BEFORE the new assistant engine existed.
+// HELD-OUT evaluation set for the «Оюун» online school, written on 2026-11-15 WITHOUT reading the
+// assistant engine (src/server/assistant/), the gate set or the assistant integration tests. It
+// replaces the nail-salon held-out set.
 //
 // Purpose: an honest measure of the engine on phrasings it was not tuned against.
 //   - Do not change the engine to make a case here pass and keep reporting it as held-out.
 //     When a failure is fixed, move that case to gate.ts and write a fresh held-out case.
 //   - It is not part of `npm test` (run it with `npm run eval:assistant`), so it cannot become
 //     a gate the engine is tuned against.
-//   - Expectations check outcomes, never the engine's sentences.
-// Run 1 (2026-11-02, rules only): 4 incorrect turns. Those cases were fixed and moved to gate.ts
-// (r1-*), and the four h2-* cases below were written as replacements before being run.
-// Clock: Tuesday 2026-11-10 09:00 Ulaanbaatar. Tomorrow = Wednesday 11-11, Saturday = 11-14,
-// Monday 11-16 is closed. Prices and staff are the seeded demo catalogue.
+//   - Expectations check behaviour and facts from the school spec, never the engine's sentences.
+//
+// Clock (EVAL_NOW): Tuesday 2026-11-10 09:00 Ulaanbaatar. Earliest start today is 11:00 (2 h
+// notice). Tomorrow = Wednesday 11-11, Thursday 11-12, Friday 11-13, Saturday 11-14
+// (09:00–20:00), Sunday 11-15 (10:00–18:00), Monday 11-16 is open (08:00–22:00; no closed weekday).
+// The customer's own booking ({REF}/{PHONE}) is on Thursday 11-12 at 16:00; somebody else's
+// ({REF_OTHER}/{PHONE_OTHER}) is on Friday 11-13 at 11:00. Their lessons are not named here, so
+// the cases do not depend on which catalogue item the world booking uses.
+// The level check is free or 5,000₮ (whichever the seed uses); expectations accept both.
