 =?UTF-8?q?=D1=8E=D1=83=D0=BD=C2=BB,=20an=20online=20school?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The fictional nail salon becomes an online school with live 1-on-1 video
lessons: 19 courses in 6 categories (English, IELTS/ЭЕШ, maths and physics,
programming, Asian languages, level check), 6 teachers with AI-generated
portraits, new Unsplash photos, school hours and policies. New design:
navy/blue/sunflower palette, Unbounded + Golos Text, home page rebuilt around
how online lessons work. All visible copy (site, booking, admin, server
messages) uses хичээл/багш/сурагч/сургууль. Code identifiers, routes and the
database slug are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
